  "limits": [
    "The probe times the in-memory AutoDriveCoordinator.onIdle route with immediate mocked projection and prompt ports, not the full OpenCode plugin host event path.",
    "The baseline has no recovery controller; the head uses a real inactive RecoveryController with a provider spy. Provider and fetch counters do not cover all possible network APIs.",
    "The head recovery-checkpoint route includes a method wrapper that counts real inactive-controller proposalPrompt calls; this slightly overstates its uninstrumented routing time.",
    "Separate process RSS snapshots include module loading and runtime variation and do not isolate a production memory regression.",
    "Shadow advice latency and the pinned live provider deadline are not measured; the JEV-2 performance gate remains open."
